 came out as changed  entrepreneurs they had new ideas and new  motivations to help them grow their  business and it felt so good I think  that was the most important thing for me  I came alive I felt so amazing during  and after it I was kind of walking on a  cloud going home and despite being so  super nervous and afraid going into it  I did it anyway and and had a lot of fun  with it and knew that I had to find a  way and I think with with all matters of  the heart you know when it's the right  thing to do you know when it feels like  it's the right thing to do when it's  something that makes you come alive and  you're just feeling it and you can't  wait to get up and go do that again that  was the high I got from that speaking  engagement and I couldn't wait to go and  do it again I was looking for my next  opportunity I had so much fun the  challenge was you know I didn't get paid  to do that it was a free thing only  three people came out and looking at  from a logical you know brain point of  view how would I ever make money doing  this right there was no logical way if I  can't get people to come to a free event  how would I ever be able to pay for this  how would ever be able make a career and  living from this and it didn't matter  right because I loved it so much  even if I had to go do something else I  would do that I keep doing this because  I loved it so much I think that's how  you know and and over you know that was  maybe 12 years ago over that course I've  changed my model around a lot and I've  tried a lot of different things and now  I get paid to go and do speaking gigs  and it's evolved - it came from a  website and became a YouTube channel and  it's always evolved around helping  entrepreneurs and it all came out of  that one  YMCA event that was a total failure  failure in most people's eyes but for me  was amazing and I knew I had to keep  going so if you don't know what your  passion is you still trying to discover  it won't and try stuff 